   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="1901_AS_RBH_2_00045" />Herrn Dr. <hi rend="latintype">Rich.
                     Beer-Hofmann</hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <hi rend="latintype">
                     <rs type="place" ref="#pmb338">I. Wollzeile 15</rs>.</hi>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline rend="right">
                  <pb facs="1901_AS_RBH_2_00047" />
                  <date>Samſtag</date>
               </dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>
               <salute>lieber Richard,</salute> ohne <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L01175-1" />
               <unclear>Praejudiz</unclear>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L01175-1">
                  <ref type="schnitzler-briefe" target="L02968" subtype="Cf" />.
               </note> für event.
               Eintritt werde ich heute Abend, am Ende ſchon zum Nachtmahl, jedenfalls aber um
                  <time>10</time>, im <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L01175-2" />
               <rs type="org" ref="#pmb169320" subtype="implied">Club</rs>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L01175-2">
                  <ref type="schnitzler-briefe" subtype="See" target="L01167" />.
               </note> ſein.</p>
            <closer>Herzlichſt<lb />Ihr<lb />
               <signed>Arthur</signed>
            </closer>
            <postscript>
               <p>
                  <rs type="person" ref="#pmb12740">Guſtav</rs> wohnt nach wie vor <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50825">Tief. Gr. 23</rs>; vielleicht iſt er aber in dieſen Tagen in
                  der <rs type="place" ref="#pmb44413">Brühl</rs>
               </p>
            </postscript>
         </div>
      </body>
